flowchart TD
    A[malloc request] --> B{Size < 128KB?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Use existing arena]
    B -->|No| D[mmap large block]
    
    C --> E{Free chunk available?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Use free chunk]
    E -->|No| G[Request more from kernel]
    
    G --> H[brk/sbrk syscall]
    H --> I[Expand heap]
    I --> F
    
    F --> J[Return pointer]
    D --> K[Return mmap pointer]
    
    L[free pointer] --> M{Was mmap'd?}
    M -->|Yes| N[munmap syscall]
    M -->|No| O[Add to free list]
    
    O --> P{Adjacent free chunks?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Coalesce chunks]
    P -->|No| R[Mark as free]
    Q --> R
    
    style F fill:#e8f5e8
    style O fill:#fff4e1
    style D fill:#e1f5ff
